 id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\kappa]^\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{H\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\operatorname{otp}(H,\\in)=\\alpha\\}\">\\([\\kappa]^\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{H\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\operatorname{otp}(H,\\in)=\\alpha\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^\\alpha_n\">\\(\\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^\\alpha_n\\)</span>（本文件定义的分划关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^\\alpha_n \\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\forall f\\;\\left((f:[\\kappa]^\\alpha\\to n)\\to\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\lambda\\;\\exists\\xi&lt;n\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f\\upharpoonright[H]^\\alpha)=\\{\\xi\\})\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partition} \\vdash \\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^\\alpha_n \\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\forall f\\;\\left((f:[\\kappa]^\\alpha\\to n)\\to\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\lambda\\;\\exists\\xi&lt;n\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f\\upharpoonright[H]^\\alpha)=\\{\\xi\\})\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa \\to (\\lambda)^{\\alpha}_{n}\">\\(\\kappa \\to (\\lambda)^{\\alpha}_{n}\\)</span> means: for any coloring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: [\\kappa]^{\\alpha} \\to n\">\\(f: [\\kappa]^{\\alpha} \\to n\\)</span>, there is a homogeneous set of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa \\to (\\kappa)^{\\alpha}_{n}\">\\(\\kappa \\to (\\kappa)^{\\alpha}_{n}\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> has the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-partition property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)$（see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$（see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)","display":f